  "description": "ProTasker is a RESTful API for users to manage tasks. Features: user auth (JWT), roles (admin/user), task CRUD, filtering & pagination, rate limiting, global error handling, background jobs for email, Swagger docs, Docker, CI/CD, live deploy.",
